<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9834] ClientImpl shouldn&apos;t fail JVM with 130 error code after node validation errors</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9834</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the current number of Ignite if client (tcp-client-disco-msg-worker) receive validation error message represented by TcpDiscoveryCheckFailedMessage then client fail with 130 error code. Semantically such behavior is invalid. Client must cancel own work in normal order.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
